<alcuin. carm. 38.1>	Munera muneribus David superaddidit Albin:
<alcuin. carm. 38.2>	Munera muneribus Christus superaddat et illi.
<alcuin. carm. 38.3>	Carmina carminibus binas superaddit et illi:
<alcuin. carm. 38.4>	Omnia dona bonus semper deus augeat illi,
<alcuin. carm. 38.5>	Et te florentem faciat, mea filias donis
<alcuin. carm. 38.6>	Atque mei David subolis clarissima donis
<alcuin. carm. 38.7>	Floreat aeternis: cuncti florete felices,
<alcuin. carm. 38.8>	Iam salvete, valete, vigete et avete, valete.
